cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PyraGate-VLM (Project Sakiko): a 4.0B 3D U-ViT video-generation backbone"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: yanfei0725
repository-code: "https://github.com/yanfei0725/PyraGate-VLM-Project-Sakiko-"
license: BSL-1.1
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  A pure-PyTorch 3D U-ViT backbone (Udit, 4.0B parameters) for video
  flow-matching generation: teacher-style AdaLN conditioning, 2+1D
  spatial-temporal attention with optional GSA gating, Dual-Act SwiGLU,
  global conditional-space MoE experts, real-form 3D RoPE, and a distilled
  training pipeline (CFG-A teacher targets, Adafactor, staged freezing).
